{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Abacus: Bead Math 把中國算盤、日本算盤與十珠計數框等經典計算工具化成色彩鮮明的互動教具，讓 4 歲以上小朋友透過撥珠即時看到數字變化，從中理解位值、加法與減法，適閤家庭與蒙特梭利式教學使用。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>四款算盤與三種玩法</h2>\n<p>內建中國算盤、日本算盤、明代算盤與十珠計數框四款，點按或滑動珠子，框下即時顯示對應數字。玩法分為造出目標數字、加法與減法三種，減法不會出現負數，並可按能力選擇三種數字範圍。兒童模式有溫和提示與較大珠子，全程離線，沒有廣告，亦不收集資料。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-333-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-334-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-335-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-336-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-337-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-338-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Abacus: Bead Math</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T08:09:38.412224+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}